        <mxCell id="p0c12" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Machine Names EU&lt;/b&gt;  -&gt;  &lt;b&gt;pbi_machine_names&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Holds: List of lines (Excel per site)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;One row is: One row per machine&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub table: 2 rows, 7 columns (Hull, downloaded 2026-10-13)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Used on pages: EU-Level Overview, Site-Level Overview, L2/L3 FIT View, Planned Losses, Unplanned Losses, Maintenance (BETA), Loss Trending, By Shift, By Format, OEE Trending (some through measures)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Columns in Power BI: 6&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Insights Hub endpoints: &lt;/b&gt;OEE /assets, Asset Management /assets/{assetId}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
