        <mxCell id="p0c19" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Plan OPT EU&lt;/b&gt;  -&gt;  &lt;b&gt;pbi_plan_opt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Holds: Actual production per machine, plus capacity and monthly targets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;One row is: Machine x date x shift x product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub table: 178 rows, 19 columns (Hull, downloaded 2026-10-13)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Used on pages: EU-Level Overview, Site-Level Overview, Planned Losses, Unplanned Losses (some through measures)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Columns in Power BI: 17&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Insights Hub endpoints: &lt;/b&gt;OEE evaluateKPIs (hourly, filter PRODUCT), filterValues, productCollections/{id}/products, calendars/{id}/calendarEvents, assets/{id}/config; Asset Management /assets/{assetId}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
