        <mxCell id="p0c47" value="&lt;b&gt;6  Calendar&lt;/b&gt;  -&gt;  &lt;b&gt;pbi_calendar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Holds: Date table generated in Power BI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;One row is: One row per date&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub table: 122 rows, 11 columns (Hull, downloaded 2026-10-13)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Used on pages: EU-Level Overview, Site-Level Overview, L2/L3 FIT View, Planned Losses, Unplanned Losses, Maintenance (BETA), Loss Trending, By Shift, By Format, OEE Trending (some through measures)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Columns in Power BI: 11&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Insights Hub endpoints: &lt;/b&gt;None: generated in the flow" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="645" width="480" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c48" value="11 OK" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c49" value="0 with gaps" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1138" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c50" value="0 assumption" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1216" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c51" value="0 needs file" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1294" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c52" value="0 empty / missing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1372" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c53" value="0 not needed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=center;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1450" y="1005" width="74" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c54" value="&lt;b&gt;How the report joins the tables (from the model)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1085" width="1500" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c55" value="&lt;b&gt;Machine key&lt;/b&gt;: every fact table joins to Machine Names EU on Unique Machine Name (hidden key, never shown). Power BI local copy = machine-site text; Insights Hub = asset ID. Decision open.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Product key&lt;/b&gt;: Plan OPT, Daily Losses and Run Rates join to the product master (Format List EU). Power BI local copy key = machine + part name; Insights Hub = product code. Own product table decided 2026-10-13.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shift&lt;/b&gt;: every fact table joins to Shift Naming EU on the shift name. All Insights Hub shift names must exist there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Date&lt;/b&gt;: every fact table joins to Calendar on the date (Daily Losses: on the shift start date).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Endpoints&lt;/b&gt;: the paths are shown without the Xcelerator service suffix. Target platform (xcelerator, from 2026-10-13): host api.eu1.siemens.app and the service name gets the suffix -1000001700, for example /api/oee-1000001700/v3/... Legacy: host gateway.eu1.mindsphere.io, no suffix (docs/platform-switch.md)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1119" width="1500" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c56" value="&lt;b&gt;Power BI tables not created from Insights Hub yet: 7 shown in the Data pane + 3 hidden supporting tables (columns on the last page)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1330" width="1500" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c57" value="The Data pane of the Power BI local copy shows 14 tables: the 6 above, the 7 below and Measures Table (calculations only, no data). The model also has 39 hidden staging tables (regional copies N, H, W, M, Provideam) that feed the EU tables. 3 of them are listed here because they feed Daily Losses." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1358" width="1500" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c58" value="&lt;b&gt;Run Rates EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Good parts and capacity per machine, shift and product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;12 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decide later (group 2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: possible: evaluateKPIs hourly (KPI &amp;quot;Good parts&amp;quot;) and the design speed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1414" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c59" value="&lt;b&gt;Volume CoV EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Per shift and machine: good parts sum and capacity max (volume variation)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decide later (group 2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: possible: evaluateKPIs per shift" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="415" y="1414" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c60" value="&lt;b&gt;Format List EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product master: brand, unit size, unit count per machine and product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8 columns. Used on: By Format&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Format Mapping files)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: productCollections/{id}/products (name, code, description, design speed). Brand, size and count: none" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="790" y="1414" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c61" value="&lt;b&gt;Targets Losses EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monthly loss target per machine and loss subgroup&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Glidepaths)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none (Glidepaths file)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1165" y="1414" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c62" value="&lt;b&gt;OEE Targets EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monthly OEE target per line&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Glidepaths)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none (Glidepaths file)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1664" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c63" value="&lt;b&gt;PDT Targets EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monthly planned downtime target per line&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Glidepaths)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none (Glidepaths file)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="415" y="1664" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c64" value="&lt;b&gt;UPDT Targets EU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monthly unplanned downtime target per line&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Glidepaths)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none (Glidepaths file)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="790" y="1664" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c65" value="&lt;b&gt;Equipment Coding (N, H, W)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maps a machine and loss description to an equipment name&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Hull file not downloaded)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none. The reason names are in /reasontrees/{id}/reasons&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hidden table: not shown in the Data pane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1165" y="1664" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c66" value="&lt;b&gt;Volume Loss Correction (N, H, W)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Loss units per day, machine and loss reason (Provideam OEE Loss report)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;10 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs file integration (Provideam report; Hull file not downloaded)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: none (Insights Hub has no loss units). Rule: stop minutes x capacity per minute&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hidden table: not shown in the Data pane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1914" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c67" value="&lt;b&gt;Targets Volume (N, H, W, M)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Capacity per machine and day (weight for the loss targets)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2 columns. Used on: no visual reads it directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Built from the Plan OPT Capacity per machine and day (not a file)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIH source: built in the flow: sum of the Plan OPT Capacity per machine and day&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hidden table: not shown in the Data pane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="415" y="1914" width="355" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c68" value="&lt;b&gt;Priority of all 16 tables (6 created, 10 not created yet)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="170" width="700" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0c69" value="Ranked by the number of visuals of the EU-Level Overview page that depend on the table (Segun&#39;s data lineage: 16 visuals and selectors). A table that only feeds a column counts the visuals that use that column. Second key: report pages that read it (Power BI file, 12 pages). The lineage covers 1 of the 12 pages, so a table with 0 visuals can still matter on another page." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
