        <mxCell id="flow-p0c302" value="&lt;b&gt;Gaps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Site: only Glidepaths and Format List have a Site Name column. The staging step adds Site Name from the folder site=&amp;lt;Site&amp;gt;, because BI Data does not turn the folder into a column.&lt;br&gt;History: the report reads from 2024-12-01. Downloaded: Aug, Sep and the current month (Hull Plan OPT also Jul).&lt;br&gt;Mira: no source files and no Machine Names, Equipment Coding or Shift Numbering (no access). Only its Glidepath and Format List are here." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
