        <mxCell id="p2c33" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The report keeps the mapped Shift value (Afternoon, Blue, Day, Gold, Green, Night, Red), not the raw Provideam name. Insights Hub calendar names Blue, Gold, Green, Red match; Yellow, Shift 1 and Shift 2 do not (mapping needed). See the sheet Explanation Shift names." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="509" width="600" height="124" as="geometry" />
