        <mxCell id="p2c40" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION + PARTLY FILLED 83%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product description, else name. Empty where no product was found for the day. Format List (Hull) check: GT4 13 of 13 names match, B2 Line 0 of 27 (SAP-style descriptions against short Provideam names). See the sheet Explanation Format List." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
