        <mxCell id="p2c54" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION + PARTLY FILLED 83%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Assumption: design speed per minute x planned minutes. In the Power BI local copy the speed is constant for only 56% of machine/part pairs. Must be clarified." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
