        <mxCell id="how2-p6c94" value="&lt;b&gt;No data source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A formula inside Power BI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;BUILT INSIDE POWER BI. Nothing to collect.&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
