        <mxCell id="p17c3" value="&lt;b&gt;ih_report: the end goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub data (OEE API) enriched with the reference files. Built by the VFC flows in the data lake folder eu_report/ih_report.&lt;br&gt;Today only Hull is configured (2 assets: B2 Line and GT4). Flows pass the mock tests but have not run in the VFC. The merge with the reference files is not built." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5efee;strokeColor=#3c9a96;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="740" height="118" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p17c4" value="&lt;b&gt;pbi_report: the data we have now&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Provideam exports from SharePoint (Hull, Nottingham, Weinheim, Dec 2024 to Oct 2026) plus the reference files, so Reckitt can open the dashboard with their own data.&lt;br&gt;Source and reference are uploaded (204 + 14 files). The VFC step that builds the 6 tables is not built. Mira: no access." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
