        <mxCell id="p17c33" value="&lt;b&gt;What ih_report covers and does not cover&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Covers: the OEE assets listed in the Config tab. Today 2 Hull lines (B2 Line, GT4), from about 2026-08-31 (the depth of the Insights Hub data). Nottingham, Weinheim and Mira are not in the Config tab (asset ids needed); the report also has Mira.&lt;br&gt;Does not cover: Provideam history before the Insights Hub data starts, product names that differ from the Format List, Provideam loss names and Loss Units (assumed as design speed x duration), shift names Yellow, Shift 1, Shift 2.&lt;br&gt;Open: how a VFC node reads the reference CSV files (untested); where the daily parquet files of the flows end up in eu_report/ih_report (the flows write below their root folder setting)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
