        <mxCell id="p17c62" value="&lt;b&gt;What pbi_report covers and does not cover&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Covers: Hull, Nottingham and Weinheim from 2024-12-01 (Hull, Nottingham) or 2025-01 (Weinheim) to 2026-10; real Provideam values for Capacity, Planned OpT, OEE Time and Loss Units; Machine Names, Equipment Coding, Glidepaths and Shift Patterns from the real files.&lt;br&gt;Does not cover: Mira (no access), Run Rates (not used), days with no export (holidays; 16 Dec 2025 Plan OPT in Hull; 17 Dec 2025 has two versions).&lt;br&gt;Refresh: after new downloads run the normalizer, then upload only the changed month files (--only, --overwrite). Nothing is automatic yet." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
