        <mxCell id="p15c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Power BI tables not created from Insights Hub yet&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p15c3" value="Columns are those of the Power BI model. The status says what the table needs. Group 2 = shift KPIs, run rate (decide later); group 3 = files that need an integration (Glidepaths, Format Mapping, Equipment Coding, Volume Loss Correction). Not analysed in the model: Handover, Shift Colours, Master Mode Comment and Full Site Shift Performance are read by visuals but are not tables of the template." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
